{"title":"Pirate","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 9 Pirate that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 27 total, 6–11 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 60% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 10 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 3/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 20% of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 1/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-longsword\" title=\"Iron Longsword - in 20% of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/96e5cd3e8991db10d473.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 1/5</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-small\" title=\"Mana Potion Small - in 20% of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4b59eb7c2796b5056c1b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 1/5</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-torso\" title=\"Imp Torso - in 20% of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b9694a40651e45e38f0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 1/5</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1559.8px,-1026.4px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/5/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/6/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:1543.0px;top:1031.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1494.3px;top:1077.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1626.9px;top:1013.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1546.3px;top:1009.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1588.4px;top:1001.1px\"></i></div><figcap